   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h2>NVRAM Manager (NvM)</h2><p class=\"lead\">Provides synchronous and asynchronous block-based data management for non-volatile storage (EEPROM, Flash).</p>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3>Funktionen — Übersicht</h3>\n<ul class=\"mlist\">\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00447\">NvM_Init</a> (const NvM_ConfigType* ConfigPtr);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service for resetting all internal variables.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00448\">NvM_SetDataIndex</a> (NvM_BlockIdType BlockId, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a> Data Index);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service for setting the Data Inde x of a dataset NVRAM block.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00449\">NvM_GetDataIndex</a> (NvM_BlockIdType BlockId, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a>* Data IndexPtr);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service for getting the currently set Data Index of a datase t NVRAM block</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00450\">NvM_SetBlockProtection</a> (NvM_BlockIdType BlockId, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00026\">boolean</a> Protection Enabled);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service for setting/ resetting the write protection for a NV block.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00451\">NvM_GetErrorStatus</a> (NvM_BlockIdType BlockId, NvM_RequestResultType* Request ResultPtr);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service to read the block dependent error/ status information.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00452\">NvM_GetVersionInfo</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00015\">Std_VersionInfoType</a>* versioninfo);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service to get the version information of the Nv M module.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00453\">NvM_SetRamBlockStatus</a> (NvM_BlockIdType BlockId, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00026\">boolean</a> Block Changed);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service for setting the RAM block status of a permanent RAM block or the status of the explicit synchronization of a NVRAM block.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00548\">NvM_SetBlockLockStatus</a> (NvM_BlockIdType BlockId, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00026\">boolean</a> Block Locked);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service for setting the lock status of a permanent RAM block or of the explicit synchronization of a NVRAM block.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00535\">NvM_CancelJobs</a> (NvM_BlockIdType BlockId);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service to cancel all jobs pending for a NV block.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00454\">NvM_ReadBlock</a> (NvM_BlockIdType BlockId, void* Nv M_DstPtr);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service to copy the data of the NV block to its corresponding RAM block.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00455\">NvM_WriteBlock</a> (NvM_BlockIdType BlockId, const void* Nv M_SrcPtr);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service to copy the data of the RAM block to its corresponding NV block.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00456\">NvM_RestoreBlockDefaults</a> (NvM_BlockIdType BlockId, void* Nv M_DestPtr);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service to restore the default data to its corr esponding RAM block.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00457\">NvM_EraseNvBlock</a> (NvM_BlockIdType BlockId);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service to erase a NV block.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00459\">NvM_InvalidateNvBlock</a> (NvM_BlockIdType BlockId);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service to invalidate a NV block.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00764\">NvM_ReadPRAMBlock</a> (NvM_BlockIdType BlockId);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service to copy the data of the NV block to its corresponding permanent RAM block.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00793\">NvM_WritePRAMBlock</a> (NvM_BlockIdType BlockId);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service to copy the data of the permanent RAM block to its corresponding NV block.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00813\">NvM_RestorePRAMBlockDefaults</a> (NvM_BlockIdType BlockId);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service to restore the default data to its corresponding permanent RAM block.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00460\">NvM_ReadAll</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Initiates a multi block read request.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00461\">NvM_WriteAll</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Initiates a multi block write request.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00458\">NvM_CancelWriteAll</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service to cancel a running Nv M_ Write All request.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00855\">NvM_ValidateAll</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Initiates a multi block validation request.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_91001\">NvM_FirstInitAll</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">The function initiates a multi block first initialization request.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00462\">NvM_JobEndNotification</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function to be used by the underlying memory abstraction to signal end of job without error.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00463\">NvM_JobErrorNotification</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function to be used by the underlying memory abstraction to signal end of job with error.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00464\">NvM_MainFunction</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service for performing the processing of the Nv M jobs.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00467\">NvM_SingleBlockCallbackFunction</a> (NvM_BlockRequestType Block Request, NvM_RequestResultType Job Result);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Per block callback routine to notify the upper layer that an asynchronous single block request has been finished.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00468\">NvM_MultiBlockCallbackFunction</a> (NvM_MultiBlockRequestType Multi Block Request, NvM_RequestResultType Job Result);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Common callback routine to notify the upper layer that an asynchronous multi block request has been finished.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a