  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3>Typen — Übersicht</h3>\n<ul class=\"mlist\">\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">struct <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00880\">NvM_ConfigType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">Configuration data structure of the Nv M module.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_91003\">NvM_MultiBlockRequestType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">Identifies the type of request performed on multi block when signaled via the callback function or when reporting to Bsw M</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">enum <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00470\">NvM_RequestResultType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">Type NvM_RequestResultType.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_00471\">NvM_BlockIdType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">Identification of a NVRAM block via a unique block identifier.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_91123\">NvM_InitBlockRequestType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">Identifies the type of request performed on a block when signaled via the callback function</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_NvM_91002\">NvM_BlockRequestType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">Identifies the type of reques t performed on a block when signaled via the callback function</span></li>\n</ul>",
